{"id":"c3a5b525cfd233c2","group":"89","path":"89/89-fact-gl-contains-k4.md","title":"fact-gl-contains-k4 — GL Contains K4","display":"fact-gl-contains-k4 — GL Contains K4","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-fact-gl-contains-k4","aliases":["89-fact-gl-contains-k4"],"display":"fact-gl-contains-k4 — GL Contains K4","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-fact-gl-contains-k4"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-fact-gl-contains-k4</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-gl-contains-k4 — GL Contains K4"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2ade50b86346886\" href=\"?note=e2ade50b86346886\" title=\"89-lem-l-implies-4\">89-lem-l-implies-4</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}contains\\text{-}k4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}contains\\text{-}k4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\)</span> : K4逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a>)</li>\n<li>GL是K4的扩充</li>\n<li>关键非定义步骤是 Löb 公理在正常模态逻辑中导出公理 4，见\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e2ade50b86346886\" href=\"?note=e2ade50b86346886\" title=\"89-lem-l-implies-4\">89-lem-l-implies-4</a>；因此 K4 的闭包包含于 GL。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-l-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"e2ade50b86346886","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnch